{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target","id":19583,"title":"$117,500's Our Target!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-27T23:48:53-08:00","id":19583,"title":"$117,500's Our Target!","content":"We've go to make that number happen people, the Devs have already clearly gone above and beyond just 'payment for wordcount'. Just look at the customer interaction, that's a proper job by itself!<br /> <br /> Upping my pledge by...the change I've got in my pocket (about \u00a35.42). Not a lot but if we can get enough pocket change...<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T00:25:27-08:00","id":19592,"title":"","content":"Upped mine by $10. And before that I had went up $40. I'm usually just a PDF guy but this time I want the whole deal: Book, Screen. If I can get more together, I'll try but it probably won't be much more at this point. Spirit is willing though. Hope we/they get this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T00:36:09-08:00","id":19597,"title":"","content":"Currently at $50 and debating whether or not to go higher. None of the bext reward tiers/add-ons interest me, but I want those stretch goals!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T00:47:18-08:00","id":19603,"title":"","content":"Go up $15 and get a sexy Storyteller Screen and then just add for justice <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/257-calrabjohns","name":"Calrabjohns","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T03:21:09-08:00","id":19637,"title":"","content":"As a non US resident, I'm already sinking a lot into this... But the next three stretchgoals are pretty damn amazing. If we haven't hit them in a few days I'll curse myself and fork over more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T05:56:44-08:00","id":19679,"title":"","content":"I'm still desperately curious about what Devs are getting paid for work like this. Or at least the conversion rate from peanuts to real monies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/635-slaunyeh","name":"Slaunyeh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T07:12:16-08:00","id":19712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Slaunyeh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=19679#post19679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm still desperately curious about what Devs are getting paid for work like this. Or at least the conversion rate from peanuts to real monies.</div> </div> </div> </div>Enough that the lead Dev on Exalted had to come to the fans for financial support for medical bills.<br /> <br /> I believe the bandied about idea is less than what they'd earn working minimum wage at McDonalds.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T08:11:34-08:00","id":19743,"title":"","content":"It's piecework that doesn't come with sufficient frequency or pay enough per working hour to make it worth it to anyone who doesn't fanatically love the job. I wholly support stretch goals like this, even though it's still mostly just tossing a few more peanuts into the pile.<br /> <br /> I already upped to my feasible limit for Heirs to Hell, but I'll pretend I upped for this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T14:09:22-08:00","id":19891,"title":"","content":"Raised my pledge to $100. Doing my part!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T16:45:03-08:00","id":19965,"title":"","content":"Ive bumped up my pledge amount to include an extra hardcover, cuz this game is pure win win!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-28T23:38:14-08:00","id":20123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=19712#post19712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I believe the bandied about idea is less than what they'd earn working minimum wage at McDonalds.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Minimum wage at McDonalds is like $20.76/hour here. So I still need a better frame of reference, I think.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/635-slaunyeh","name":"Slaunyeh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T01:22:22-08:00","id":20133,"title":"","content":"\u00a36.08 per hour here in the UK.<br /> <br /> Hmmm. Average UK wage is \u00a326,500 per year.<br /> <br /> Really basic calculations.<br /> <br /> \u00a36.08, assuming 40 hours per week = \u00a3243.2 per week.<br /> <br /> 52 weeks a year = \u00a312,646.4 a year.<br /> <br /> UK defines the poverty line (for a single adult) as \u00a3100 per week AFTER tax, national insurance, rent, mortgage, water, electricity, heating etc. has been paid.<br /> <br /> Meaning that if they spend \u00a3144 a week of bills then they're classed as in poverty. Apparently average UK rent is \u00a3681 per month so about \u00a3170.25 per week.<br /> <br /> Seeing the problem here?<br /> <br /> In the US<br /> <br /> Average national wage (median) is $50,502 per year.<br /> <br /> According to google the US minimum wage is $7.25, for 60 hour weeks (apparently they work longer in the US as that's the number bandied around) = $435 per week<br /> <br /> 52 weeks per year = $22,620<br /> <br /> US poverty line in 2012 was $23,050 per year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/291-scutarii","name":"Scutarii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"702"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T10:16:22-08:00","id":20232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=20133#post20133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In the US<br /> <br /> Average national wage (median) is $50,502 per year.<br /> <br /> According to google the US minimum wage is $7.25, for 60 hour weeks (apparently they work longer in the US as that's the number bandied around) = $435 per week<br /> <br /> 52 weeks per year = $22,620<br /> <br /> US poverty line in 2012 was $23,050 per year.</div> </div> </div> </div>60 hour work weeks are... not the standard here. Its a 40 hour work week and past that is &quot;Over-time&quot; which is usually time and a half pay.<br /> <br /> Minimum wage jobs are almost never full time, because the company would have to pay benefits at 30+ hours. Servers and Waitresses don't get minimum wage always, and are taxed on their tips.<br /> <br /> Most McDonald's employees, as well as any other food service employees are on government assistance in some way, food stamps etc and are generally well below the poverty line.<br /> <br /> Not sure where the 60 hour work week you came up with was, that might be the maximum permissible with overtime, but it is generally only reachable if you have a union factory job or similar employment.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T12:46:39-08:00","id":20304,"title":"","content":"Might be accounting for people who work multiple jobs, which is not that uncommon, especially among minimum wage workers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T15:22:26-08:00","id":20396,"title":"","content":"Most minimum wage employees in the US end up working 2-3 jobs. I wouldn't be at all surprised if many of them work 60-75 hours a week, spread out over three jobs, such that they don't get benefits or overtime. Or a living wage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T21:00:50-08:00","id":20490,"title":"","content":"Despite my ire towards PDF goals we upped ours to 110. Depending on his next check we may go for higher.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T23:20:03-08:00","id":20515,"title":"","content":"Updated my pledge. Added $10... we now have $8,937 to go to reach this stretch goal as of my posting this message.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;Seven deadly sins/Seven ways to win/Seven holy paths to hell/And your trip begins/Seven downward slopes/Seven bloodied hopes/Seven are your burning fires/Seven your desires&quot; \u2014 Iron Maiden,</i> Moonchild","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1122-the-grim-lich","name":"The Grim Lich","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T09:46:37-08:00","id":20672,"title":"","content":"Freelance writer rates in the RPG industry vary; I think the average I've seen is 3 cents a word. I've never been paid more than 10 cents a word, and that was a rush job (&quot;I need 4000 words by tomorrow morning!&quot;). When I hire writers for Growling Door, I pay 4 or 5 cents a word, depending on what I've budgeted (I don't hire writers often, at least not so far). <br /> <br /> Developer and editor rates tend to be lower (but the word counts are higher). <br /> <br /> Believe me, guys, getting this pay bump would be a big deal. Some freelancers just use the money as gravy, because they have steady day jobs, but some of them rely on the money to pay bills and feed kids and so on. So, for everyone who's upping their pledge, <i>thank you</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T10:14:34-08:00","id":20680,"title":"","content":"Still waiting on that overdue disability payment I mentioned to you and Dave so I can make my pledge, I want the deluxe book along with the screen. 3 bulging disks and arthritis in my lower back kept me out of work for a couple of months. I'm finally back at work but need to pay rent and doctor bills first.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T11:00:44-08:00","id":20695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=20672#post20672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Believe me, guys, getting this pay bump would be a big deal. Some freelancers just use the money as gravy, because they have steady day jobs, but some of them rely on the money to pay bills and feed kids and so on. So, for everyone who's upping their pledge, <i>thank you</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Man, you have no idea how much I wish I could bump my pledge, just to hit that Stretch Goal. If it weren't for moving and all of the expenses that entails, I would. Even so, it's killing me not to, and if I can scrape up some extra cash by the end of the KS, I'm going to do it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-30T11:03:48-08:00","id":20696,"title":"","content":"Also, David Hill posted this on his G+, and I'm sharing with permission. He also made sure to say that Onyx Path has, and I quote, &quot;consistently provided for me over the years.&quot; So this doesn't seem to be indicative of Onyx Path at all - or really any company in particular, I suppose - just the overall RPG industry as a whole.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+DavidHillJr/posts/ch4okgS8TzR\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEil-tQSvWkISdvbujn818sEroZRYYKpRGceE-TwpWRdVewQPlU0imIwcmg0yno39j1pZ-zoJgqmivcU0Sip6hAyaceJ4f488VTs_9tsqXZC15AlQZOxx4QPIGkS0HxkcOGSkG3BSGLRzdoXKHq9mmvfwaF5t011Gi_VPQ7DxrtpCgu7M5sODOd-XciE/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/GWS_Timeline_Chrono_LINKS%20(2).png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+DavidHillJr/posts/ch4okgS8TzR\" target=\"_blank\"> Google Workspace Updates: New community features for Google Chat and an update on Currents </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://plus.google.com/+DavidHillJr/posts/ch4okgS8TzR\" target=\"_blank\"> https://plus.google.com/+DavidHillJr/posts/ch4okgS8TzR </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T13:39:03-08:00","id":21269,"title":"","content":"Well I'm new here, but I just wanted to say I'm loving demon. And it is the first project I have ever backed. Once I read into it I simply needed to have a prestige edition. I've currently backed as much as I can afford, but if I can scrap together some more money I'll up my pledge. I think the writers have done a fantastic job and deserve the pay bump.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1447-othikent","name":"Othikent","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-01T22:56:38-08:00","id":21459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blackhatmatt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=20672#post20672\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Believe me, guys, getting this pay bump would be a big deal. Some freelancers just use the money as gravy, because they have steady day jobs, but some of them rely on the money to pay bills and feed kids and so on. So, for everyone who's upping their pledge, <i>thank you</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>We absolutely have to reach that goal. Ya'll deserve it and more. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, thanks for sharing the numbers. It's just an idle curiosity of mine, that only grows when some people treat questions about pay like some great taboo. Very illuminating, so cheers for that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/635-slaunyeh","name":"Slaunyeh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T09:52:43-08:00","id":21722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scutarii</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/19583-117-500-s-our-target?p=19712#post19712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Enough that the lead Dev on Exalted had to come to the fans for financial support for medical bills.<br /> <br /> I believe the bandied about idea is less than what they'd earn working minimum wage at McDonalds.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It sucks that work that I value so highly pays so poorly. I missed this about needing financial support for medical bills.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1459-robotdjuret","name":"RobotDjuret","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-02T09:55:09-08:00","id":21725,"title":"","content":"To put that in perspective: at $.03 a word, that's $750 for a 25,000 word document. I've written that much on a professional level exactly once, and it took me months. Even considering that a professional writer is going to be more efficient... That's not much for that much work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.c